{"title":"2013 Mock AIME I","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>2013 Mock AIME I</b> was written by AoPS users Siddharth Prasad, David Altizio, Kyle Gettig, Justin Stevens, and Kevin Sun and proofreaded by Evan Chen and Lawrence Sun.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems\"> Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Answer Key\"> Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 2\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 3\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 4\"> Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 5\"> Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 6\"> Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 7\"> Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 8\"> Problem 8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 9\"> Problem 9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 10\"> Problem 10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/in